  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract inherited from multiple actions, related to: AVP 2024 - Expenditure Verification Regional Port. - The overall objective of the Technical Cooperation Facility 1 under 11th EDF is to contribute to the effective implementation of the EA-SA-IO Regional Indicative Programme. The specific objective of the Action is to ensure high-quality identification and formulation of EU funded regional actions under the EA-SA-IO RIP.</narrative>
